  (text "No servo pulses are produced while IO25 is high-Z (R10). What the servo/blade does WITHOUT pulses, after supply loss,\nor on a fault is NOT established: the mechanical safe state is UNRESOLVED and is not claimed by this circuit.\nServo power is NOT taken from the logic regulator. Servo current path widths are BLOCKED pending servo stall current."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 139.7 0)
